   "source": [
    "## 2. Expanding mean, sd, skew, kurtosis\n",
    "\n",
    "For a run matrix `X` of shape `(T, n_sensors)`, at row `t` the four numbers are pandas `mean / std / skew / kurt` of samples `1…t` (excess kurtosis, bias-corrected). Sample 1 has only a mean; sd starts at 2, skew at 3, kurtosis at 4.\n"
   ]
  },
